* Simple NMOS test with Berkeley BSIM4 C kernel
.MODEL NMOS_TEST NMOS2 (LEVEL=2 VTH0=0.4 KP=100e-6 U0=0.05 VSAT=8e4 UA=1e-9 UB=7.8e-19 UC=-4.9e-11 TOX=5e-9 CGSO=5e-10 CGDO=5e-10 CGBO=5e-10 GAMMA=0.4 LAMBDA=0.01 TNOM=300.15 TEMP=300.15)

* DC operating point: VDS=1V, VGS=1.5V
V1 DRAIN 0 DC 1.0
V2 GATE 0 DC 1.5
V3 BULK 0 DC 0.0

M1 DRAIN GATE 0 0 NMOS_TEST W=10e-6 L=1e-6 USEBERKELEYKERNEL=1

.OP
.END
